## Review contract

Return criterion-level verdicts, not a holistic quality score; do not grade document shape.
Parallel plans are the default. Accept imperfect parallel plans as planning
artifacts and assess their substance here; advisory validator findings are
not automatic rejection criteria. Step plans also encourage parallel execution
of independent ready work and may gain parallel units during refinement.

